		{
			description: [
				" Welcome to Spell Grade Gardening, it's a magic modpack to enjoy, explore, create and fight with magic."
				""
				" Despite being heavily modded (170 mods), it's a simple journey, loaded with redstone ingenuity, trial and error, and exploration of mechanics."
				""
				" The quest book is here as a guide on &obasic mechanics&r, and to teach the &obasic progression&r (since things are meant to be gated behind Botania) but won't (and shouldn't) tell you what to do and how to do things, meaning there won't be a time where you will be looking through the quests on how to \"complete the pack\", that's not a thing here."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:oak_sapling"
			id: "45526045F2926948"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3C3E582361AB8E7F"
				type: "xp_levels"
