			description: [
				" There are some towers spread across the map, and one that generates pretty close to world spawn, some of them have a maze like dungeons underneath, I highly reccomend checking them out right at the beginning of a save, it contains some pretty good loot."
				""
				" Check the Evil Craft chapter for some relevant gear."
				""
